# ERP Software V1 - Product Requirements Document

## 1. Executive Summary

### 1.1 Product Overview
A comprehensive Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) software designed to provide essential business management functionality for organizations of all sizes. V1 focuses on core modules that address fundamental business operations and processes.

### 1.2 Target Market
- Small to medium-sized businesses (SMBs)
- Growing enterprises requiring integrated business management
- Organizations transitioning from manual processes or multiple disconnected systems
- Industries: Manufacturing, Retail, Services, Distribution, and General Business

### 1.3 Success Metrics
- User adoption rate > 80% within 6 months
- Reduction in manual data entry by 60%
- Improved process efficiency by 40%
- Customer satisfaction score > 4.5/5
- 99.5% system uptime

## 2. Product Vision & Goals

### 2.1 Vision Statement
"To provide a unified, intuitive, and scalable ERP solution that empowers businesses to streamline operations, enhance productivity, and make data-driven decisions through integrated modules and real-time insights."

### 2.2 V1 Goals
- Establish core ERP functionality across essential business domains
- Provide seamless integration between modules
- Ensure user-friendly interface for non-technical users
- Support multi-user access with role-based permissions
- Enable real-time reporting and analytics
- Ensure data security and compliance

## 3. Core Modules & Features

### 3.1 User Management & Authentication
**Priority: Critical**

#### Features:
- User registration and profile management
- Role-based access control (RBAC)
- Multi-factor authentication (MFA)
- Password policies and security
- User activity logging
- Session management

#### User Roles:
- System Administrator
- Finance Manager
- HR Manager
- Inventory Manager
- Sales Manager
- General Employee
- Viewer (Read-only access)

### 3.2 Financial Management
**Priority: Critical**

#### Core Features:
- **General Ledger**
  - Chart of accounts management
  - Journal entries
  - Account reconciliation
  - Financial period management

- **Accounts Payable**
  - Vendor management
  - Purchase order processing
  - Invoice management
  - Payment processing
  - Vendor payment history

- **Accounts Receivable**
  - Customer invoicing
  - Payment tracking
  - Credit management
  - Aging reports
  - Collection management

- **Banking**
  - Bank account management
  - Bank reconciliation
  - Cash flow management
  - Bank statement import

#### Reports:
- Balance Sheet
- Income Statement
- Cash Flow Statement
- Trial Balance
- Aging Reports
- General Ledger Reports

### 3.3 Inventory Management
**Priority: High**

#### Core Features:
- **Product Catalog**
  - Product creation and categorization
  - SKU management
  - Product variants and attributes
  - Barcode/QR code support
  - Product images and descriptions

- **Stock Management**
  - Real-time inventory tracking
  - Stock levels and alerts
  - Inventory valuation (FIFO, LIFO, Average Cost)
  - Stock transfers between locations
  - Cycle counting

- **Warehouse Management**
  - Multiple warehouse support
  - Location management
  - Bin/shelf management
  - Picking and packing processes

#### Reports:
- Inventory Status Report
- Low Stock Alerts
- Inventory Valuation Report
- Stock Movement Report
- ABC Analysis

### 3.4 Sales Management
**Priority: High**

#### Core Features:
- **Customer Management**
  - Customer profiles and history
  - Customer categorization
  - Contact information management
  - Customer credit limits

- **Sales Process**
  - Lead management
  - Opportunity tracking
  - Quote generation
  - Sales order processing
  - Invoice generation

- **Sales Analytics**
  - Sales performance tracking
  - Sales forecasting
  - Customer analysis
  - Product performance

#### Reports:
- Sales Summary Report
- Customer Sales Report
- Product Sales Report
- Sales Forecast Report
- Commission Reports

### 3.5 Purchase Management
**Priority: High**

#### Core Features:
- **Vendor Management**
  - Vendor profiles and history
  - Vendor performance tracking
  - Vendor categorization
  - Contact information management

- **Purchase Process**
  - Purchase requisition
  - Purchase order creation
  - Receiving management
  - Purchase invoice processing
  - Payment management

#### Reports:
- Purchase Summary Report
- Vendor Performance Report
- Purchase Order Status Report
- Cost Analysis Report

### 3.6 Human Resources
**Priority: Medium**

#### Core Features:
- **Employee Management**
  - Employee profiles and records
  - Organizational structure
  - Position and department management
  - Employee history tracking

- **Time & Attendance**
  - Time tracking
  - Leave management
  - Overtime tracking
  - Attendance reports

- **Payroll Integration**
  - Basic payroll data export
  - Salary information management
  - Deduction tracking

#### Reports:
- Employee Directory
- Attendance Reports
- Leave Reports
- Department Reports

### 3.7 Reporting & Analytics
**Priority: High**

#### Core Features:
- **Dashboard**
  - Executive dashboard
  - Role-based dashboards
  - Key performance indicators (KPIs)
  - Real-time data visualization

- **Report Builder**
  - Custom report creation
  - Report scheduling
  - Export capabilities (PDF, Excel, CSV)
  - Report templates

- **Analytics**
  - Trend analysis
  - Comparative analysis
  - Drill-down capabilities
  - Data visualization (charts, graphs)

## 4. Technical Requirements

### 4.1 System Architecture
- **Frontend**: Web-based responsive interface
- **Backend**: RESTful API architecture
- **Database**: Relational database with ACID compliance
- **Security**: HTTPS, data encryption, secure authentication

### 4.2 Technology Stack
- **Frontend**: React.js/Vue.js with responsive design
- **Backend**: Python (Django/Flask) or Node.js
- **Database**: PostgreSQL or MySQL
- **Authentication**: JWT tokens with refresh mechanism
- **File Storage**: Cloud storage integration (AWS S3, Azure Blob)

### 4.3 Performance Requirements
- Page load time < 3 seconds
- API response time < 500ms
- Support for 100+ concurrent users
- 99.5% uptime
- Data backup every 24 hours

### 4.4 Security Requirements
- Data encryption at rest and in transit
- Regular security audits
- GDPR compliance
- Role-based access control
- Audit logging for all critical operations

## 5. User Experience Requirements

### 5.1 Interface Design
- Clean, modern, and intuitive design
- Responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile
- Consistent navigation and user experience
- Accessibility compliance (WCAG 2.1)
- Multi-language support (English, Spanish, French)

### 5.2 User Workflows
- Streamlined data entry processes
- Bulk operations for efficiency
- Auto-save functionality
- Search and filter capabilities
- Keyboard shortcuts for power users

### 5.3 Onboarding
- Interactive tutorials
- Contextual help and tooltips
- Sample data for demonstration
- User guide and documentation
- Video tutorials for complex features

## 6. Integration Requirements

### 6.1 External Integrations
