## 10. Risk Assessment & Mitigation

### 10.1 Technical Risks
- **Data Security**: Implement encryption, regular audits
- **System Performance**: Load testing, optimization
- **Integration Failures**: Fallback mechanisms, error handling
- **Data Loss**: Automated backups, disaster recovery

### 10.2 Business Risks
- **User Adoption**: Comprehensive training, intuitive design
- **Competition**: Unique features, competitive pricing
- **Regulatory Changes**: Flexible architecture, compliance monitoring
- **Market Changes**: Agile development, regular feedback

