## 12. Conclusion

This V1 PRD outlines the foundational features required for a comprehensive ERP solution that addresses the core business needs of organizations. The focus is on delivering essential functionality with high reliability, security, and user experience while maintaining scalability for future growth.

The success of V1 will be measured by user adoption, operational efficiency improvements, and customer satisfaction, setting the foundation for advanced features in subsequent versions.
